Manage subscription sources and refresh node inventory

Usage: xrm sub [OPTIONS] [SUBCOMMAND]

OPTIONS:
  -h,   --help            Show this help message 

SUBCOMMANDS:
  add                     Add a subscription source 
  list                    List sources without URL credentials 
  show                    Show a source summary; --json includes its editable 
                          URL 
  edit                    Edit source name and/or URL 
  update                  Refresh one source or all sources; never applies 
                          runtime files 
  remove                  Remove a source while preserving its nodes 

GLOBAL OPTIONS (before the command):
        --socket PATH     xrmd Unix domain socket 
        --json            Write machine readable output 
        --verbose         Include original diagnostics in human errors 

Examples:
  xrm sub list
  xrm sub show Local
  xrm sub add --name Local --url http://127.0.0.1:8080/sub --paused

Next: xrm sub <command> --help
